    "required_outcome": "Query syntax is built from escaped literal terms; the words AND, OR, NOT, NEAR, a column filter, a `*` prefix and an unbalanced quote are all literal text, never a caller-supplied MATCH expression, and never a syntax error. Supports matrix row 12."
